.TH ALI-MIRRORS 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-mirrors \- switch apt to the fastest Debian mirror
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sudo ali-mirrors
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetches trixie InRelease from each candidate mirror (TR first),
picks the fastest reachable one, rewrites the apt sources
(DEB822 URIs or one-line), keeping a .ali-bak backup, then runs
.B apt-get update .
Needs root and network.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-update (1),
.BR sources.list (5)
